            "text": "theorem mellin_hHc_mul {g : ℝ → ℂ} (hg : AEStronglyMeasurable g (volume.restrict (Ioi 0)))\n    {C b : ℝ} (hC : 0 ≤ C) (hgb : ∀ t : ℝ, 0 < t → ‖g t‖ ≤ C * (t ^ b * Real.exp (-t ^ 2 / 2)))\n    {s : ℂ} (hs : 0 < s.re + b) :\n    mellin (fun t => hHc t * g t) s =\n      ∫ ξ in Icc (-aH) aH, 𝓕 gC ξ * mellin g (s + ((2 * π * ξ : ℝ) : ℂ) * I) :=",
