  "note": "Lean never forms η_{+,2}: prop_9_5_1 splits log n = log x + log(n/x) (Prop715.lean:324) and treats φ₁ = η₊² and φ₂ = η₊²·log separately, so the convolution is only needed for η₊²; the log t weight enters through M(φ₂) = M(φ₁)′ (hasDerivAt_mellin_phi1)."
